Third-Party Software
====================

Fast Figure incorporates third-party software distributed under the licenses
below. These notices apply to their respective third-party components.

The split distribution carries third-party runtime files separately under
vendor/; the inline distribution embeds the same runtime files into the
generated Fast-figure.html. Selected Iconoir SVG definitions are embedded in
the application HTML. The split ZIP also includes this LICENSE file.


Iconoir
=======

Component version: 7.11.1
Source repository: https://github.com/iconoir-icons/iconoir

Fast Figure embeds selected Iconoir SVG definitions directly in the application
HTML used by both distributions.

