Plotly.js
=========

Component version: 2.35.2
Bundled distribution: https://cdn.plot.ly/plotly-2.35.2.min.js
Source repository: https://github.com/plotly/plotly.js
Documentation: https://plotly.com/javascript/
License source:
https://github.com/plotly/plotly.js/blob/v2.35.2/LICENSE

Fast Figure carries the minified Plotly.js distribution as
vendor/plotly.min.js in the split package and embeds the same file into the
inline HTML build. The bundled distribution retains its own version, copyright,
and license header.

