React / ReactDOM
----------------

Component version: 19.2.8
Source repository: https://github.com/facebook/react

Fast Figure carries React and ReactDOM in
vendor/fast-figure-ui-runtime.js in the split package and embeds that runtime
into the inline HTML build.

